🛠️ Exploitation Strategy: Time-Based Bypass
Unlike other challenges that require header spoofing (e.g., X-Forwarded-For), this specific instance tracks limits strictly by time. The solution is to slow down the attack to stay under the threshold. 

The Logic
Batching: Send exactly 9 login attempts (one less than the limit of 10). 
Waiting: Pause for 32 seconds (slightly more than the 30s window) to force the server to reset the counter. 
Repeating: Continue this cycle until the correct credential pair from the provided dump is found. 

